Comment: 0,0:00:59.03,0:00:59.07,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,== OP ==
Comment: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:05.89,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,== ED ==
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:11.49,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Elementary School Entrance Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Was that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.57,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's all blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.99,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, Kouki, stand next to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.84,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Say "cheese"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:33.97,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take a photo of you with Rin too, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I don't need a shot of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:39.72,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have to! She'll be all grown up before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:41.56,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have to keep a record of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:49.36,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you need to smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:55.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! How many times have I told you not to go wandering off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:02:59.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a big girl now, so act like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:01.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:03.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me an "Uh-huh"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have this snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Snack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it looks good...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you ever had cereal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:18.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I can finish this though...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't mind buying it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:27.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's the kind of thing you have for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay to eat sweets with rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:33.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,...How do I put this? It may look like sweets...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but you can have it as a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:39.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you have it for breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:43.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you gonna have it too, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:48.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah. It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Put your cereal in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:58.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Daikichi, you stink at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:01.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}My fingers are too dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You're like Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Then I'll watch you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, there are cherry blossoms over here, so let's go home this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:17.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're blooming all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's warm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huge, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're starting elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,what do you say we plant something to commemorate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Commemorate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:34.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of like a remembrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:39.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, the two of you will get bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:40.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:43.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I have my own tree, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,At home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,By my parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:50.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When I was born, they planted a fragrant olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:53.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For Kazumi, they planted a tea olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:55.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is a fragrant olive tree the kind that smells good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know about tea olive trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:03.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the tea olive tree has some plain flowers and not much of a smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Kazumi used to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"It's not fair! You get the one that smells nice!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:09.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And then she'd tear the flowers off my olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:13.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When I offered to trade, she said "I don't {\i1}want{\i0} your hand-me-downs!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:20.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... It didn't leave a nice memory, so why do I want to put Rin through the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:25.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I think you should get a pretty flower or a plant that blooms, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Or at least some fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:28.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want a loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:30.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, a loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:39.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I have some loquat seeds from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You plant the seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat as many loquats as I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's if they actually grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:50.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I was thinking of planting a tree that's about as tall as you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:51.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't plant the loquat seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:56.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It takes longer for a tree to grow compared to morning glories and other flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's like that expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"It takes three years for peaches and chestnuts to bear fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,...and persimmons take eight"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Grandpa's girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:05.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How long for loquats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:09.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know, but what if it takes like 10 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:15.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,By that time, you'll probably be more interested in fancy sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:23.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry, it'll be a long time before we can eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:33.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. If it's too deep, the bud won't be able to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:33.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:43.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're Grandpa's girl through and through...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hope the bud comes up soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:46.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:50.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know what a ninja is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:54.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kouki says he's gonna be a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:59.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ninjas jump over a hemp plant every day, while the plant gets taller and taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:04.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,By the time the plant is full grown, they can jump incredible heights!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try that with your loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:10.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:19.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how tall does a loquat tree get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,About as high as our roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:28.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's probably about right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:41.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right. After ten more times!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it'll sprout tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:49.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Probably not by tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:51.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:59.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My teacher said someone from home has to check my schedule too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't do this when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:10.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. It says "Please confirm."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.72,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(250,250)}Words for Communication
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:14.05,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(250,0)}Fun Arithmetic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.80,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Police car, I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:25.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, attach this whistle to my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:35.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If somebody you don't know starts talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,you blow on this as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:41.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And then run to the nearest house!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:41.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A store is fine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:44.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! School!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:01.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:09.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I eat some of it like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:10.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:18.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't pet dogs eat stuff like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:21.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's only for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:22.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:27.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,People can't eat dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so depressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:35.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Rice balls are still number one though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.76,0:09:41.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Those rice balls are tough to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:49.90,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:54.03,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! Kouki was so enthusiastic that he rushed out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:09:59.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:00.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.41,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:09.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you've got burrs all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:12.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of animal trail did you run through?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get a comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:20.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:26.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, your schoolbag is all scratched up now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:31.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I bet you ran that stick across people's walls too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:33.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a mind reader?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You did the same thing when you were little, didn't you Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, hurry up and get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You still have time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not supposed to blow that unless something happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:09.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Quit blowing that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:14.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When you really do need help, nobody's gonna come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:21.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.30,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're not supposed to take detours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:49.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a detour. It's a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.23,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that ninjas...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:56.48,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,...always take paths like these!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It zigzags!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:05.99,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:31.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're making the shortcut pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what it's for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:13.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That kid's hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:17.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:20.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really, almost all boys are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:22.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:26.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The only ninja training I condone is jumping over the loquat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:27.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:38.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that loquat's a school entrance remembrance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:45.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But your olive tree is a reminder from when you were born, so it's a little different, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:50.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I don't have anything like a fragrant olive tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:53.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a sharp girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:57.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did that mother of hers plant a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's one at Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:04.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Grandpa might've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't know anything about one, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:08.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:13.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And Grandpa's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:18.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know about it, no one does, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I never should've told her about the olive tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You've got your elbow on the table again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:29.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:43.06,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:49.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think we'd be meeting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think I'd see you again either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is from her school entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.83,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.46,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A tree for Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.93,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There is one! There was one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:12.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.64,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I think there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:18.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so iffy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.35,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Because Souichi's the one who planted it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:23.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So he did...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:32.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to move that tree to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of tree is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:36.24,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A small one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, do you know what kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:40.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And where...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.92,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, it's still small...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.29,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And the branches are thin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:47.75,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:52.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}are{\i0} an artist, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:56.01,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not paid to draw maps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:58.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:15:59.14,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.77,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,The sun rises in the west, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The opposite! It rises in the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind the directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just draw the street that's in front of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.53,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah... Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:16.06,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I've got work to do, so excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.41,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you when you're so busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I have my own tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:48.15,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Grandpa planted something for you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.15,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's what my heart tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:54.20,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,And even if there isn't, I think you can plant another tree
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.11,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,to commemorate starting elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.41,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,A six-year-old tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.50,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to see Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I wanna see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's big, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:11.71,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it's 30 years old, just like Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It got big, and so did he!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fragrant olive tree, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.76,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You know your trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.48,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,This one's Kazumi's tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tea olive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.89,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:32.11,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember the big tree in Grandpa's backyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:43.08,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's my tree, another tea olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:44.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? This tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:56.51,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa planted it when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:05.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You have the same tree as Kazumi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.10,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:12.48,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,When I was a child, I always compared my height to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:16.65,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I loved it, which is why I continued the tradition here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:20.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that a tea olive tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:23.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi compare his height with his tree, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.33,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:34.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:36.38,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:40.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It has the same leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a six-year-old fragrant olive tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:56.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:58.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's too late to jump over this one, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think even I could do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:25.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And we weren't even aware Rin existed until six months ago, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.56,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:31.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The train's gonna leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:33.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.61,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:44.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,long before the day we first met,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:59.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,we were all already walking down the same path.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:40.52,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:44.53,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:45.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.61,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a strange old man outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}No... That man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Daikichi, he's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:54.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Enough! Both of you, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:57.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's our neighbor, Mr. Matsui!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:22:00.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call him a "strange old man"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:10.97,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... sor...ry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.72,Default,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:16.43,Default,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, my sudden greeting frightened him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.48,Default,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:21.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, he was incredibly rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:24.11,Default,Matsui-san,0000,0000,0000,,Well, be careful going to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:32.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When you ran away, you dragged Rin along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:41.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki made a mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:44.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If Kouki's with you, I feel a little more reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:45.92,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:47.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, just a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.05,0:22:48.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.84,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late...
