Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:17.99,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:21.04,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:27.91,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:32.42,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
